  "details": "When you switch between multitasking and back to VRCHAT the avatar often freezes and I have to restart, recently I found two workarounds. One, you press the Quest button five times which brings up the logs and diagnostics report window and then I click back into the VRCHAT world and regain control of my avatar. Two, disable AFK detection, this I have only figured out in the last few days, so far my avatar hasn't frozen when switching back to VRCHAT after a multitasking session with AFK detection disabled.",
